<p class='title'>B. ĐỀ KIỂM TRA CHÍNH THỨC - TIẾNG ANH 6 (GLOBAL SUCCESS)</p>

<p><b>PART I: LISTENING (2.0 points)</b></p>
<p><i>Task 1: Listen and choose the correct answer A, B, C or D (1.0 pt)</i></p>
<p>1. What time does Mai usually get up on school days?<br>
A. 6:00 AM &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; B. 6:30 AM &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; C. 7:00 AM &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; D. 7:15 AM</p>
<p>2. How does she go to school?<br>
A. By bus &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; B. By bike &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; C. On foot &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; D. By car</p>

<p><b>PART II: LANGUAGE & VOCABULARY (2.0 points)</b></p>
<p><i>Choose the word whose underlined part is pronounced differently:</i></p>
<p>3. A. pl<u>ay</u>s &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; B. st<u>ay</u>s &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; C. d<u>ay</u>s &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; D. s<u>ay</u>s</p>
<p>4. Look! The students ________ football in the school playground.<br>
A. play &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; B. are playing &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; C. played &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; D. plays</p>

<p><b>PART III: READING (2.0 points)</b></p>
<p><i>Read the passage and choose the best answer:</i></p>
<p>My new school is in a quiet village. It has twenty classrooms, a modern computer room and a large library. All the students wear uniforms on Mondays and Fridays...</p>

<p><b>PART IV: WRITING (2.0 points)</b></p>
<p><i>Rewrite the following sentences without changing their meaning:</i></p>
<p>1. There are twenty-five students in my class.<br>
➔ My class ....................................................................................</p>
<p>2. My favorite subject is English.<br>
➔ I like .........................................................................................</p>

